<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Life 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Life 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income		 1.69 trln   vs	    1.77 trln</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	 523.70	  vs	  638.20</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	   2.00 trln   vs	    1.29 trln</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	  79.70	  vs	  127.90</p>
<p> Total assets		  23.19 trln   vs	   23.14 trln</p>
<p> Unrealised equ pft	 731.70	  vs	  316.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Life Insurance Co is the full company name.</p>
</text>
